      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "\ud83d\udc8e Guide: Native Qwen-Image-2.1 360\u00b0 Panorama (No LoRA)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83c\udf10 Qwen-Image-2.1 \u2022 Native 360\u00b0 VR Panorama (No LoRAs)\n\nPure Base Model inference utilizing Qwen-Image-2.1's native panorama expansion capability!\n\n\u2022 **Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (Zero LoRAs \u2014 pure base DiT math)\n\u2022 **Sampler**: `euler` / `simple` at **25-30 steps**, **CFG 1.0** (1 forward pass/step)\n\u2022 **Speed & Resolution on 8GB GPU**:\n  - **1536x768 (Fast 2:1, Recommended Default)**: Fits 100% in VRAM, ~2.5s/step (~60-75s total)!\n  - Followed by **QwenPanoramaUpscale** (seamless 360 boundary) to 2048x1024 (takes <1s).\n  - **2048x1024 (Native 2K)**: Requires ~3.5GB activation offloading; takes ~12-18 min on 8GB GPU.\n\u2022 **Prompt Schema**: Explicitly steers the base model:\n  *\"Transform this image into a 360 equirectangular spherical panorama. Scene: ... seamless 360 horizon.\"*\n\u2022 **Interactive 360 Viewer**: Drag to look around in 360\u00b0, scroll to zoom FOV, or toggle auto-rotation."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \ud83c\udf10 Qwen-Image-2.1 \u2022 Native 360\u00b0 VR Panorama (No LoRAs)\n\nPure Base Model inference utilizing Qwen-Image-2.1's native panorama expansion capability!\n\n\u2022 **Model**: `qwen_image_2.1_Q5_K_M.gguf` (Zero LoRAs \u2014 pure base DiT math)\n\u2022 **Sampler**: `euler` / `simple` at **25-30 steps**, **CFG 1.0** (1 forward pass/step)\n\u2022 **Speed & Resolution on 8GB GPU**:\n  - **1536x768 (Fast 2:1, Recommended Default)**: Fits 100% in VRAM, ~2.5s/step (~60-75s total)!\n  - Followed by **QwenPanoramaUpscale** (seamless 360 boundary) to 2048x1024 (takes <1s).\n  - **2048x1024 (Native 2K)**: Requires ~3.5GB activation offloading; takes ~12-18 min on 8GB GPU.\n\u2022 **Prompt Schema**: Explicitly steers the base model:\n  *\"Transform this image into a 360 equirectangular spherical panorama. Scene: ... seamless 360 horizon.\"*\n\u2022 **Interactive 360 Viewer**: Drag to look around in 360\u00b0, scroll to zoom FOV, or toggle auto-rotation."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
